


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_52e17b31:


    "晚饭后的休闲时光。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_21d6f632:


    "加上圣夜子，四人围坐在桌边虽有些拥挤，但时间还是依然缓慢地流逝着。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_0906cab2:



    voice "2FU_0073"
    fumi "「嘿咿咻」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_085199df:


    "放好四个杯子后，文坐下了。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_5001462c:



    voice "2MI_0053"
    miyako "「这个是……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_56b1cf19:


    "被杯子里飘出的香气所吸引，圣夜子用鼻子嗅了嗅。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_e21aae9e:



    voice "2FU_0074"
    fumi "「今天晚上试着做了苹果茶。并不是用茶包，而是用苹果的皮来做的呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_333fa8d7:



    voice "2MI_0054"
    miyako "「这就是苹果茶啊。颜色很漂亮呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_2115620a:


    "杯中的水面上倒映出充满好奇的眼神。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_aa948095:



    voice "2RI_0096"
    rin "「诶，鹰冈同学是第一次喝苹果茶吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_f0f7b6ac:



    voice "2MI_0055"
    miyako "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_ea7539fc:



    voice "2FU_0075"
    fumi "「这样的话请一定要品尝一下。很好喝的哦～」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_89242288:



    voice "2HI_0100"
    hina "「其实我一直都不太能接受苹果茶呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_cb5b23e3:


    "桌子下的阳菜突然提出了异议。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_ad7aac66:



    voice "2HI_0101"
    hina "「苹果茶完全尝不出苹果的味道啊！明明闻起来是苹果的味道」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_4e6d6b81:



    voice "2RI_0097"
    rin "「噢噢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_de248570:



    voice "2HI_0102"
    hina "「第一口总是被闻起来的香味骗到」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_a90cdfff:



    voice "2FU_0076"
    fumi "「不放糖的话的确就是茶的味道呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_ac09cd73:



    voice "2RI_0098"
    rin "「真是的，阳菜小宝贝就喝苹果汁吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_80d63667:



    voice "2HI_0103"
    hina "「不用你说我也会喝的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_49752957:



    voice "2FU_0077"
    fumi "「那就给这个这样的阳菜，这个」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_2561ce56:



    voice "2FU_0078"
    fumi "「那就给这样的夏目同学，这个」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_af846210:


    "这么说着，文拿出来的是——"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_621437a4:



    voice "2HI_0104"
    hina "「苹果！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_9ca38ddf:



    voice "2FU_0079"
    fumi "「这是削好皮的苹果」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_55a29611:



    voice "2HI_0105"
    hina "「我吃我吃～」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_dcf35770:


    "这样，阳菜也高兴了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_492832a3:



    voice "2HI_0106"
    hina "「苹果闻起来是苹果的味道，吃起来也是苹果的味道！」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_71f94971:



    voice "2RI_0099"
    rin "「这不理所当然的事情吗，还用说」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_209c5c9b:



    voice "2MI_0056"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_fae0872f:


    "圣夜子一脸不可思议地看着阳菜。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_f6e4765d:


    "阳菜一直以来的经验告诉她，苹果就得有苹果味。所以才不能接受苹果茶。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_c95e2fdc:


    "然而，对于无论苹果茶还是苹果都是第一次品尝的圣夜子来说，感觉不到违和。不能理解伦所说的“理所当然”。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_8a6a5858:



    voice "2FU_0080"
    fumi "「圣夜子也要吃苹果吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_162777cb:


    "看到盯着苹果看的圣夜子，文问道。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_aec1ecd4:



    voice "2MI_0057"
    miyako "「啊，嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_3a8b8f18:


    "圣夜子知道苹果茶闻起来是苹果的味道，也知道苹果是苹果的味道。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_7726c7e8:


    "但这些味道，她都并没有切身品尝过。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_ec82bff0:


    "经验和知识的获取顺序颠倒了。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_afd8ce35:


    "现在获得了色觉，可以区分青苹果和红苹果了，但想要分辨味道之间的不同，还需要亲身经历。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_7a81ca36:



    voice "2MI_0058"
    miyako "「我先尝一尝苹果茶」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_8f1b3f7d:



    voice "2FU_0081"
    fumi "「还很烫，小心——」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_59c9e563:


    "文还没来得及提醒，圣夜子便已经将杯子放到了嘴边。"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_7c633236:



    voice "2MI_0059"
    miyako "「啊！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a07_comn_06_1d82c790:


    "是的，连温度也顺带经历了。"
